[al:新概念英语第一册]
[ti:9. How Are You Today]
[00:00.260]Lesson 9 | 第9课
[00:02.510]Good afternoon, Mrs. Davis. | 下午好，戴维斯夫人。
[00:05.785]Good afternoon, Mr. Ford. | 下午好，福特先生。
[00:08.915]How are you today? | 你今天好吗？
[00:11.515]I'm very well, thank you. | 我很好，谢谢你。
[00:13.780]And you? | 你呢？
[00:15.450]I'm fine, thanks. | 我很好，谢谢。
[00:18.805]How is Mr. Davis? | 戴维斯先生好吗？
[00:21.725]He's fine, thanks. | 他很好，谢谢。
[00:24.210]How is Mrs. Ford? | 福特夫人好吗？
[00:26.715]She's very well too, Mrs. Davis. | 她也很好，戴维斯夫人。
[00:31.230]Goodbye, Mrs. Davis. | 再见，戴维斯夫人。
[00:34.445]Nice to see you. | 很高兴见到你。
[00:36.110]Nice to see you too, Mr. Ford. | 我也很高兴见到你，福特先生。
[00:39.485]Goodbye. | 再见。